  "description": "Build a Word document from code with a fluent API for DocWright: pages, headers and footers with page numbers, text, tables with repeating header rows, lists, images, charts, form fields and real Word styles. Render it to PDF, images or .docx through the same pipeline as a loaded document, or keep editing it as a WordDocument. A composition is ordinary C#, so loops, conditionals and your own data just work.",
